# Global Filter Scrollability & Consistency Update (Phase 2)

## Goal Description
Ensure all filter dropdowns across the entire application are scrollable, visually consistent, and use the premium custom dropdown styling. This phase completes the refactoring for [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html) and standardizes the dropdown handlers in [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js) and [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js).

